rth-wife-height-and-career.html"}, {"title": "johnny damon bio net worth wife height and career", "url": "https://cfe.keltyeatingdisorders.ca/johnny-damon-bio-net-worth-wife-height-and-career.html"}, {"title": "reference.org", "url": "https://reference.org/facts/Johnny_Damon/JsJAM2LD"}, {"title": "Johnny Damon", "url": "https://wikipedia2007.classicistranieri.com/j/o/h/Johnny_Damon_2c64.html"}, {"title": "All you need to know about Johnny Damon", "url": "https://solarc.sol-ark.com/all-you-need-to-know-about-johnny-damon.html"}]}, "Sources agree that Damon played Little League as a boy in the Orlando area, but they disagree on which league it was.\n\n- **Early moves:** Damon was born at Fort Riley, Kansas, and moved often as an Army brat, living in Okinawa and West Germany. The Damon family settled in the Orlando, Florida, area while Johnny was a pre-schooler.\n- **Little League:** Wikipedia says he played in South Orange Little League as a child. UPI's profile instead says he played in Dr. Phillips Little League as a child. The Wikipedia version is the more commonly repeated one, but I couldn't confirm which is correct.\n- **Junior high:** Wikipedia says he played for the Walker Jr. High baseball team before attending Dr. Phillips High School in Orlando. A few other bios repeat Walker Junior High.\n- **Other childhood details:** He had a stutter, and attended speech therapy."], "durationSeconds": 4.9138287499999995, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_012GZFQEtr7FHWiGHbeaQXzH", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
